oh and more note. given that space is almost always sufficient to separate
words from each other maybe {valsi bu} for space will fit better? Even for
{coi zei coi} we understand that both {coi} and {zei} are words.
because indeed {kunti bu} looks extremely hackish. not a very kunti symbol.

